This package is a derivative work of DSH Desktop
(https://github.com/dataelement/dsh-desktop, MIT, Copyright (c) 2026 DataElement),
specifically of its bundled plugin `plugins/dsh-desktop-project`. The host-side
project-mode RPCs — the directory listing, the source read/write, the search and
grep, the push-status ledger, the script runner and the `.dshpreset` archive
endpoints — are ported from it under the MIT terms above.

The client-side panel shipped in `lib/client.js` is a new, self-contained
implementation that does not modify any `@deepseek-ai/*` core package.
